            ("p", "This episode is older, but one idea from it has stuck with me for days: the <em>patriarchal bargain</em>."),
            ("yt", "KvbLepJMnb8", "\"Cheating Culture, Modern Dating, Patriarchy & Feminism\", Saloni Khanna on Figuring Out with Raj Shamani (YouTube). The patriarchy section is near the end."),
            ("h", "What she explained"),
            ("p", "Saloni Khanna, an economist and educator, describes it as a concept from sociology. A woman who suffered under patriarchy as a young daughter-in-law later becomes the mother-in-law, and instead of ending the cycle, she passes it on. \"We went through worse, so you can handle this.\" She gets out of the prison, and lets the next woman in."),
