            ("p", "Before that, she and Raj discuss women and money. Many women still hand their salary or financial decisions to someone else. Raj pushes back that financial literacy is a problem for everyone in India, men included, and they land somewhere in the middle: it comes down to who around you is talking about money."),
            ("h", "Why this one is personal"),
